Model and artifact attribution
------------------------------

The selected runtime uses the upstream FeatDistill Expert 4 SigLIP checkpoint
as a frozen feature encoder and teacher. SynthFlag does not claim authorship or
training of that checkpoint. The selected residual heads and routing graph are
project artifacts. The project owner accepts the collaborator's attestation
that the residual heads and their training inputs are rights-cleared for project
use; this repository does not claim an independent license audit.

Checkpoint binaries, benchmark pixels, and protected per-image scores are not
distributed in this Git repository. External artifact links are access
locations, not redistribution grants or proof of competition eligibility.
